    "file_name": "XIN_ENG_20051124.0147.tml",
    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051124.0147\n\nBAGHDAD, Nov. 24 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nRoadside bomb kills two Iraqi soldiers north of Baghdad\n\n\n\n\nA roadside bomb hit an Iraqi army patrol north of Baghdad on Thursday, killing two soldiers, a local source told Xinhua.\n\n\"The explosion occurred in Baiji, around 200 km north of Baghdad. Another seven Iraqi soldiers were wounded in the blast,\" the source from the US-Iraqi Joint Coordination Center in Tikrit said.\n\nInsurgents frequently target US and Iraqi military patrols with car bombs and roadside bombs in a bid to topple the US-backed government formed in April.",
